(Pump Station Maintenance Manual, Stations PS-3 and PS-4) '
() '
(SYNTHETIC SAMPLE DOCUMENT. Written for the personal-ai-brain evaluation set. The utility,) '
(equipment and limits are invented.) '
() '
(1. Scope) '
() '
(This manual covers routine maintenance of the four centrifugal pumps at stations PS-3 and) '
(PS-4 of the river intake. Each pump is driven by a 250 kW induction motor at 1,480 rpm and) '
(moves up to 1,100 cubic metres of raw water per hour.) '
() '
(Maintenance is planned in three tiers: weekly walk-round inspections by the operator,) '
(monthly condition monitoring by the reliability technician, and an annual overhaul by the) '
(mechanical contractor. Chapter 2 sets the vibration limits, chapter 3 the bearing) '
(lubrication schedule, and chapter 4 the shutdown and isolation procedure.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
