(2. Vibration monitoring) '
() '
(Vibration is measured on both motor bearings and both pump bearings as RMS velocity in mm/s,) '
(in the 10 Hz to 1 kHz band, following ISO 10816-3 for machines on rigid foundations.) '
() '
(Limits for these pumps:) '
() '
(Below 2.8 mm/s - good condition, no action.) '
() '
(2.8 to 4.5 mm/s - acceptable, record the trend and check monthly.) '
() '
(4.5 to 7.1 mm/s - alert: increase monitoring to weekly and plan a repair.) '
() '
(Above 7.1 mm/s - danger: stop the pump within 24 hours and inspect.) '
() '
(A rise of more than 25% between two monthly readings is treated as an alert even when the) '
(absolute value is still in the acceptable band. Most alerts on these pumps have been caused) '
(by bearing wear or by impeller imbalance after debris strikes.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
