(3. Bearing lubrication) '
() '
(Pump bearings are grease-lubricated rolling element bearings. Use a lithium-complex grease) '
(of NLGI grade 2. Do not mix with polyurea greases.) '
() '
(Regrease the pump bearings every 2,000 running hours with 30 grams per bearing. Regrease the) '
(motor bearings every 4,000 running hours with 20 grams per bearing. Add grease slowly with) '
(the pump running and stop when the bearing temperature starts to rise.) '
() '
(Bearing temperature should stay below 80 C. A temperature above 90 C, or a rise of 15 C) '
(above the normal running value, means the pump must be stopped and the bearing inspected.) '
(Over-greasing is a common cause of high temperature after maintenance.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 595 842] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 11 0 R >>
