14 TL
56 790 Td
(4. Shutdown and isolation) '
() '
(Before any work inside the pump casing, the pump must be isolated under the permit to work) '
(system. Close the suction and discharge valves, lock both with personal padlocks, and lock) '
(out the motor isolator at the motor control centre.) '
() '
(Drain the casing through the drain valve and confirm zero pressure on the casing gauge) '
(before opening any flange. Two people must be present for confined-space entry into the) '
(suction well.) '
() '
(After work, the permit holder removes the locks, the operator primes the pump, and the pump) '
(runs for 30 minutes under observation before it returns to automatic control.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
